  "remarks": "Yuri Kushnerov is the Chairman of the Board of Directors of JSC Neftechemservis, a Russian company which owns and operates the Yaya oil refinery in the Kemerovo Oblast. Yuri Kushnerov is also the co-owner of LLC “Anzhersky Oil and Gas Company LLC”, LLC “Anzhersky Oil Refinery” and LLC “Oil Refinery ‘North Kuzbass’”, which are companies involved in the production of petroleum products on the Yaya refining site.",
